# Runtime dependencies for Holly (server archetype). Exact pins only; never a range.
# This is the manifest. The lock is requirements-runtime.txt, the set the container image installs,
# hash-pinned and generated from this file:
#   uv pip compile requirements-runtime.in --universal --python-version 3.12 --generate-hashes -o requirements-runtime.txt
# Never edit a lock by hand. Recompile this one, then requirements.txt, then requirements-dev.txt.
